# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IUM Fee Management - environment template
#
# The application is split into two packages. Each reads its own env file:
#   server/.env  -> API + MongoDB Atlas + Gemini   (copy server/.env.example)
#   client/.env  -> optional Vite overrides        (copy client/.env.example)
#
# Quick start:
#   1. cp server/.env.example server/.env
#   2. Put your MongoDB Atlas connection string in MONGODB_URI
#   3. npm install
#   4. npm run dev
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# See server/.env.example for the full list of server variables.
